 "id": 1824473,
 "titulo": "10/1&nbsp;Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1727679613563,
 "modificada": 1750910887628,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1824473",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1722906561666\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2a27745b529548b78cc13148d3d198a9_1722906561666_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">In this patch, meet a Super Villain who has returned to MARVEL Future Fight&nbsp;<br>\nto find powerful mutants and take over their bodies.</span></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Apocalypse</span>, who plans to rule the world with his immortal body,&nbsp;<br>\nhas received a new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated hero<br>\nby downloading the 10/1 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[10/2&nbsp;(Thu) 2:49 (UTC+0), 10/1 (Wed) 19:49 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of&nbsp;10/2 (Thu) 2:47 (UTC+0), 10/1 (Wed) 19:47 (PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 10/1&nbsp;Patch Details</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 10/2 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 10/1 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances and the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ One New Uniform</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">One new Uniform Apocalypse &lt;Heralds of Apocalypse&gt; has been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The new Uniform can be purchased after the 10/1 Patch data has been applied.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The new Uniform can be found and purchased at the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects of the new Uniform are based on Lv. 10 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1727403842257\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b9774fe2660f4fca8465a52fd5517c2d_1727403842257_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Apocalypse Tier-4</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"border:none; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Apocalypse is available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nHe will continue to evolve constantly to build his power stronger.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1727340022950\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bfab0841fc2040e1b43df6f52037e0fa_1727340022950_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣&nbsp;New Artifact</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">A new Artifact for Apocalypse has been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1727340078062\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/797d888c98a64ecc8c6decbe7c6874f4_1727340078062_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1. The effects of certain attacks of World Boss: Legend+ &lt;Corvus &amp; Proxima&gt; have been changed. &nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2. The name of the Uniform Hulkbuster &lt;Thorbuster&gt; has been changed to Hulkbuster &lt;Celestial Hulkbuster&gt;.</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;that will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">Thank you.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1727340160469\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fe3dbbb773d0494aa28e8b6c217c2685_1727340160469_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
